tile.fluxecho.nexus.name=Flux Nexus
fluxecho.nexus.tip=§3The nexus pinned into the flux layer: research, manifestation and modules start here§r\nDraws its upkeep from the team wireless network\nFormed: curved ribs hold a turning ring, the core floats in its middle, a beam runs up into the sky
fluxecho.nexus.structure=§bPhase I: an 11×11 octagonal base, 6 high§r\n· Base: Flux Frame Base, the eight spokes Lit Frame Base\n· Middle: three Flux Conduits, a Crystal Seat on top\n· The four diagonals: Frame Pillars, 2 high three blocks out, then 2 high one block further in (curved ribs once formed)\n· Layer 6: a ring of 16 Ring Segments\n· The core sits on the front rim of the base, two blocks above it (a Console Stand under it), facing out\n· Each later phase adds a stage on top: pillars, conduits, a seat, a ring\nStructureLib's hologram projector previews and builds it\nNEI preview: tiers 1–5 are phases I–V, 6–10 the same with modules on the inner ring
